entries.english:
Active and passive debts, and suretyships, of the Herren von Rosenberg and their relatives.

Date range: 1517, 1538–1559, 1574–1584, 1598–1618

Contents:
1. Folios 4–19: Debt claim by the steward Georg Grösser or his son Christoph Grösser against the heirs of the deceased Konrad von Rosenberg, 1538–1534;
2. Folios 20–34: Debt claim by Konrad von Berlichingen against Stoffel Tremel zu Dainbach, a subject of the von Rosenberg, 1598–1601;
3. Folios 35–66: Co-suretyship by Albrecht Christoph von Rosenberg for a loan made by Dietrich von Ehrenberg to Georg Philipp von Berlichingen, 1599–1601;
4. Folios 67–150: Legal proceedings, first before the court at Bütthard and on appeal before the Würzburg regional court, between Hans Hofmann zu Grünsfeld on one side and Nikolaus Henkel, Vogt zu Gnötzheim of the von Rosenberg, and his associates, acting as guardians of the children of Mangold Rumel zu Aub, on the other, concerning interest from an estate endowed for alms, 1600–1603;
5. Folios 158–164: Efforts by Hans Friedrich Schenk von Synaw to obtain the estate of his brother, Rittmeister Hans Heinrich Schenk von Synaw, who had served the von Hohenlohe, 1605–1606;
6. Folios 165–219: Debt claim by Albrecht Christoph von Rosenberg against Georg Truchseß von Baldersheim zu Aub or his heirs, (1597) 1606–1609;
7. Folios 220–250: Debt claim by Eva von Hatzfeldt, née von Wichtenstein, against residents of Epplingen, (1579) 1603–1609;
8. Folios 253–318: Settlement of the inheritance of the deceased Philipp Ernst von Berlichingen zu Sennfeld, 1611–1613;
9. Folios 319–324: Claims by the von Hutten family against Anna Maria von Heusenstein, née von Berlichingen; her debts, death, and estate, 1618;
10. Folios 347–364: Legal proceedings before the Würzburg regional court between Dr. Anton Hübner zu Würzburg, plaintiff, and Zaisolf von Rosenberg, concerning a debt claim, 1555–1559;
11. Folios 365–378: Indemnity letters for the Herren von Rosenberg in connection with their assumption of suretyships, 1517, 1549, 1574–1584, 1607–1609.

Extent: 1 volume, folios 1–378.
